        {
          "id": 3496984522,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Doing this (which is what the gzip handling code does) seems to result in a LZ4 frame header wrapped around zero data instead of an empty file. I don't know if there's any reason to do this in the other case, but an empty file does seem ok.",
