      "title": "lz4: Don't try to flush if not initalized yet",
      "message": "lz4: Don't try to flush if not initalized yet\n\nIf the LZ4 stream hasn't been initialized with anything, don't try\nto flush it (which will crash.) Fixes a crash on pcapng passthrough.\n\nAlso check if the stream state has been initialized or not when closing.\n\nAI-Assisted: no\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2026-06-25T23:17:16.000-04:00",
